+|Swap control|||No|[WGL_EXT_swap_control](https://www.opengl.org/registry/specs/EXT/wgl_swap_control.txt)|No|[GLX_EXT_swap_control](https://www.opengl.org/registry/specs/EXT/swap_control.txt)||
